# CI 修复:显式列出 build context,避免 BuildKit 看到 .git/、build/、.gradle/ 等大目录
# 触发 cache key 频繁变化(尤其 gradle.properties 等被 commit 但 .gradle/ 在 container 内生成)。

.git/
.gradle/
build/
.classpath
.project
.settings/
bin/
out/
*.iml
.idea/
.vscode/
dependency-check-suppressions.xml
.trivyignore
*.sarif
*.log
node_modules/
coverage/
*.tar
*.zip
